  "summary": "I’m a Senior Software Engineer with 5+ years of experience building the systems that help large-scale content\nplatforms stay fast, reliable, and easy to evolve. My journey at Roblox has taken me from developing content APIs\nand modernizing legacy services to designing distributed platforms, caching systems, and event-driven workflows\nthat operate at significant scale.\nAlong the way, I’ve developed a strong interest in distributed systems, high-throughput APIs, scalable content\nprocessing, and the architecture behind dependable developer and user experiences. I work mainly with C#, Go,\nRust, Kafka, Redis, CockroachDB, gRPC, and cloud-native infrastructure, while enjoying the bigger picture just as\nmuch as the code itself. I also value working closely with product, data science, ML, and engineering teams, sharing\nideas, mentoring others, and turning complex technical challenges into practical solutions.",
