      "description": "• Engineered Roblox's content-systems foundation in Go and C#/.NET with declarative metadata services, Kafka, gRPC, CockroachDB, Elasticsearch, and Kubernetes-style\nresource models, supporting configuration-driven content processing at 20M events daily.\n• Developed a multi-layer distributed cache with C#/.NET, Redis, and Rust/Moka using request coalescing, stale-while-revalidate, circuit breaking, and load shedding, cutting\nCPU 80%, instances 85%, and sustaining 12M RPS spikes.\n• Co-designed an event-driven orchestration platform with C#/.NET, Kafka, gRPC, CockroachDB, AWS SQS, Lambda, and Nomad, executing 125M workflow invocations daily\nand dispatching 2,500 steps per second.\n• Scaled sandboxed media-transcoding workflows with Nomad autoscaling, content-addressed storage, deduplication, and S3 delivery to 127M daily transcodings across video,\nimage, audio, advertising, and real-time avatar workloads.\n• Strengthened authorization and production reliability through a ReBAC Zanzibar-style permission service handling about 5M checks per second, full-stack observability, SLO\ndashboards, PagerDuty runbooks, and on-call mentoring that reduced user-impacting incident MTTR to low double-digit minutes.",
      "insights": ""
     },
     {
      "title": "Software Engineer",
      "timePeriod": {
