      "totalDuration": "3 yrs 7 mos",
      "description": "• Owned the Creator-Inventory-API and redesigned uploads around S3 multipart transfers, pre-signed URLs, SQS, and Kafka, increasing supported file size from 50MB to\n10GB+ while eliminating creator timeout failures.\n• Architected scalable content storage and APIs with C#/.NET, CockroachDB, Redis, Elasticsearch, gRPC, REST, and OAuth2, supporting hierarchical content management and\nconsolidating fragmented services behind 1 canonical API gateway.\n• Modernized a legacy content platform into observable gRPC microservices and migrated billions of MSSQL records to CockroachDB using Debezium, Kafka CDC, dual writes,\nbackfills, checksum validation, HAProxy, and Consul with zero data loss and zero-downtime cutover.",
      "insights": ""
